{"id": "sfo-fox-rental-fees-and-fines", "title": "SFO billed Fox Rent A Car $130,951 after a rental-fee audit", "seconds": 56.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "a5027de7c18acb9e", "words": 141, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An Airport audit calculated an underpayment and several possible fines.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.84, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "did", "Fox", "owe", "the", "Airport?"], "sub": "The rental car audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.75, 1.14, 1.8, 1.98, 2.8, 3.03, 3.46, 3.98]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Controller found 10,811 dollars in underpaid transportation fees.", "t0": 4.96, "t1": 10.4, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10,811", "label": "Underpaid transportation fees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.68, 0.96, 1.26, 1.8, 2.06, 2.4, 2.78, 3.27, 3.46, 4.02, 4.95]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Airport invoiced those fees along with late charges and audit costs.", "t0": 10.52, "t1": 14.75, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Airport invoice", "heading": "Three separate components", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Transportation fees", "value": "$10,811"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Late charges", "value": "$7,609"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Audit costs", "value": "$70,531"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.65, 1.11, 1.4, 1.78, 2.08, 2.27, 2.53, 3.12, 3.3, 3.65]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A second invoice charged 42,000 dollars for a late revenue statement.", "t0": 14.87, "t1": 19.57, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "June 30, 2011", "mark": "June 30, 2011"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.55, 1.07, 1.56, 2.14, 2.57, 3.01, 3.2, 3.28, 3.57, 4.02]}, {"scene": "fines", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The audit also calculated possible fines for missing statements and operating hours.", "t0": 19.79, "t1": 24.9, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "The audit estimate", "mark": "The audit estimate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.56, 0.93, 1.52, 2.03, 2.52, 2.72, 3.1, 3.71, 3.95, 4.53]}, {"scene": "fines", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The 42,000 dollar invoice was already included in the missing-statement estimate.", "t0": 25.02, "t1": 29.82, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Possible contract fines", "heading": "contractual fines", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "missing statements", "value": "$224,500"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "operating hours", "value": "$219,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.71, 1.1, 1.48, 1.97, 2.2, 2.66, 3.17, 3.26, 3.35, 4.2]}, {"scene": "fines", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Airport said it would not pursue the 219,000 dollar operating-hours fine.", "t0": 29.94, "t1": 34.93, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "operating hours"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.66, 0.85, 0.92, 1.08, 1.25, 1.7, 1.79, 2.01, 2.33, 2.78, 3.16, 3.52, 4.47]}, {"scene": "fines", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Auditors could not verify older revenues from the records Fox kept.", "t0": 35.05, "t1": 38.97, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Historical revenues", "mark": "Historical revenues"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 0.77, 0.95, 1.48, 1.81, 2.31, 2.49, 2.61, 3.05, 3.47]}, {"scene": "fines", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Fox said it had restored 24-hour operations.", "t0": 39.09, "t1": 42.27, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Airport oversight"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.62, 0.74, 0.89, 1.3, 2.22]}, {"scene": "fines", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "In 2018 a competitive selection proposed replacing Fox with Sixt at the rental center.", "t0": 42.39, "t1": 47.92, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "issuer", "kicker": "San Francisco Airport Commission", "text": "Rental Car Center", "mark": "Rental Car Center"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.98, 1.06, 1.63, 2.15, 2.63, 3.23, 3.61, 3.87, 4.36, 4.52, 4.64, 5.02]}, {"scene": "fines", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The records leave collections open and establish no link to the later selection.", "t0": 48.04, "t1": 52.77, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Invoices collected", "Later selection"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.57, 0.83, 1.5, 2.02, 2.23, 2.82, 3.08, 3.39, 3.53, 3.65, 3.97]}, {"scene": "fines", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 52.89, "t1": 55.5, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The transportation fees", "fines": "How the audit counted possible fines"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "contrast"}